[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5828886472","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123816#issuecomment-5828886472","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123816","id":5828886472,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABW22_yA","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-25T07:50:42Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T07:50:42Z","body":"Probably a regression from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120976 which changed the order of static deinitialization. That being said, your code here is wrong, the initialization order of static vars is not defined in GDScript (keyword: Static Initialization Order Fiasco, SIOF) the same is true for their deinitialization. As a consequence deinitialisation of a static var must have no dependencies on other static vars because it can fail if that var was cleared up prior.\n\nThe error is misleading, I'll see if we can somehow catch this in a meaningful way without tanking perf all the ti