the better error. Yet, I do not know how I would have implemented the performance monitor otherwise. I suppose a dedicated way to track instances would be better than a custom performance monitor, yet meanwhile or if that is never added, I don't know.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5829060443/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5829536185","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123816#issuecomment-5829536185","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123816","id":5829536185,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABW3epuQ","user":{"login":"theraot","id":1212509,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTI1MDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1212509?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot","html_url":"https://github.com/theraot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-25T08:43:20Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T08:43:20Z","body":"I found a workaround for my use case:\n\n```\n\t\tif Engine.get_main_loop() == null:\n\t\t\treturn\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin